# Pairs with NoTrimPastLiveNeed. Production before the fence: a sweep that read
# the leaf's row as a husk removes the pin by consumer id, unconditionally, even
# though a purge-cleared leaf re-created under the same grain id has seeded its
# block pin since the sweep enumerated the key. The re-created leaf's
# un-checkpointed writes are then trimmed.
MODULE: NoTrimPastLiveNeedUnfencedRemoval
TARGET: NoTrimPastLiveNeed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a husk read removes the pin even after a re-created leaf merged into it
PERTURBS: Decide

--- FIND
                    /\ k \notin touched[p]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the removal is not fenced against a later merge.
                    /\ TRUE
--- END
